<http://data.silknow.org/object/15b019ce-bf45-330c-9d19-01c7e5d0ce89>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Cover of silk brocade, woven in silver thread (now much worn), salmon pink and blue on a blue ground. Two horizontal rows (one incomplete) of irises, each consisting of a long pointed leaf and a blossom on a slender curved stem. The border is filled with a wavy floral stem interlaced with arabesques. There is a cotton and purple silk lining."@en , "PERSIAN; late 16th or early 17th century.\nBrocaded double cloth.\n2 warps: 2 wefts: 1 brocade weft.\nWarp: 1 / silk, blue; 2 / silk, salmon pink.\nWeft: 1. silk, blue, 2. silk, salmon pink brocade, silver metal strip on a white silk core.\nSelvage. 2 cord white silk.\nBorders of cloth tissue.\n18-1903. []"@en , "Cover, brocaded silk, Iran, early 19th century."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/e8bc76a4-57d9-3b5e-8fe0-f27b61ce5701> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Cover of silk brocade, woven in silver thread (now much worn), salmon pink and blue on a blue ground. Two horizontal rows (one incomplete) of irises, each consisting of a long pointed leaf and a blossom on a slender curved stem. The border is filled with a wavy floral stem interlaced with arabesques. There is a cotton and purple silk lining."@en , "Cover, brocaded silk, Iran, early 19th century."@en , "PERSIAN; late 16th or early 17th century.\nBrocaded double cloth.\n2 warps: 2 wefts: 1 brocade weft.\nWarp: 1 / silk, blue; 2 / silk, salmon pink.\nWeft: 1. silk, blue, 2. silk, salmon pink brocade, silver metal strip on a white silk core.\nSelvage. 2 cord white silk.\nBorders of cloth tissue.\n18-1903. []"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/15b019ce-bf45-330c-9d19-01c7e5d0ce89/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/15b019ce-bf45-330c-9d19-01c7e5d0ce89/dimension/1> ;
        dc:identifier                  "18-1903" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs>
                <https://collections.vam.ac.uk/item/O98817> .

